#: arrayfire.md:1
msgid "Installing PLUMED2 with ARRAYFIRE support"
msgstr "ARRAYFIRE 対応 PLUMED2 のインストール"

#: arrayfire.md:2
msgid ""
"The purpose of this tutorial is to guide the user step-by-step through the "
"process of compiling and installing PLUMED with ARRAYFIRE, an open-source "
"library that supports a wide range of hardware accelerators for parallel "
"computing."
msgstr ""
"並列計算用の多様な Hardware Accelerator に対応する Open-source ライブラリ ARRAYFIRE とともに、PLUMED"
" をビルド・インストールする手順です。"

#: arrayfire.md:4
msgid ""
"In this specific scenario, the library is used to take advantage of CUDA-"
"based GPUs to speed up the SAS calculation (ATOMISTIC / MARTINI / PARAMETERS"
" / ONEBEAD representations). Furthermore, in order to show a real-life limit"
" case, this installation example is performed on Leonardo, an HPC hosted by "
"CINECA and managed by the SLURM scheduler."
msgstr ""
"ここでは CUDA GPU で SAS（ATOMISTIC / MARTINI / PARAMETERS / "
"ONEBEAD）を高速化します。実際の難しい条件の例として、CINECA の SLURM 管理 HPC、Leonardo で行います。"

#: arrayfire.md:6
msgid ""
"To keep the working environment clean and compatible with other setups, in "
"this guide the modules are not automatically loaded via .bashrc, "
".bash_aliases, or other configuration files, but are invoked during "
"installation and then managed via the SLURM batch script used to submit jobs"
" to the HPC."
msgstr ""
"ほかの設定との互換性と整理のため、Module を .bashrc などで自動ロードせず、インストール時と投入用 SLURM Script "
"で管理します。"

#: arrayfire.md:8
msgid "1. Loading essential modules"
msgstr "1. 必要な Module の読み込み"

#: arrayfire.md:10
msgid ""
"To install ArrayFire, certain dependencies are required. Often, these "
"dependencies are already available on HPC systems and can be loaded through "
"modules. It is important to note that dependencies may also have their own "
"dependencies, such as compilers or essential libraries. In general, to view "
"the available modules on a SLURM-based HPC, you can use the command:"
msgstr ""
"ArrayFire の依存は HPC に用意され、Module でロードできることが多いです。Compiler "
"や基本ライブラリなど、依存自体の依存にも注意してください。通常、利用可能な Module は次で調べます。"

#: arrayfire.md:14
msgid ""
"For a comprehensive list of requirements and additional installation "
"suggestions, please visit the [official ARRAYFIRE GitHub "
"page](https://github.com/arrayfire/arrayfire/wiki/Build-Instructions-for-"
"Linux). Continuing with the Leonardo example, here is the list of basic "
"modules that can be loaded directly from the shell:"
msgstr ""
"全要件と助言は [ARRAYFIRE 公式 "
"GitHub](https://github.com/arrayfire/arrayfire/wiki/Build-Instructions-for-"
"Linux) を参照してください。Leonardo で Shell からロードする基本 Module は次です。"

#: arrayfire.md:28
msgid ""
"Other required modules are available from Leonardo, but for general purposes"
" and to provide useful examples, the other dependencies will be installed "
"manually in the next steps. It is assumed that the downloads are stored in "
"the home folder."
msgstr "ほかの依存も Leonardo にありますが、汎用的な例として次で手動インストールします。ダウンロード先は Home とします。"

#: arrayfire.md:30
msgid "2. Building dependencies from source"
msgstr "2. 依存の Source ビルド"

#: arrayfire.md:31
msgid ""
"Let's start by creating a folder where all the codes will be installed:"
msgstr "コードのインストール先を作ります。"

# Literal notation or identifier intentionally preserved.
#: arrayfire.md:35
msgid "FFTW"
msgstr "FFTW"

#: arrayfire.md:36
msgid ""
"Download the \"Fastest Fourier Transform in the West\" package version "
"3.3.10:"
msgstr "Fastest Fourier Transform in the West 3.3.10 をダウンロードします。"

#: arrayfire.md:41 arrayfire.md:87
msgid "Extract the archive:"
msgstr "Archive を展開します。"

#: arrayfire.md:45
msgid "Copy the extracted folder to fftw-3.3.10_f and move into it:"
msgstr "展開先を fftw-3.3.10_f に Copy して移動します。"

#: arrayfire.md:49
msgid ""
"The FFTW libraries must be built separately with single and double precision"
" support. The next command configures the installation with 32-bit floating "
"point support:"
msgstr "FFTW は単精度と倍精度を別々にビルドします。次は32-bit Float 用です。"

#: arrayfire.md:53 arrayfire.md:174 arrayfire.md:215
msgid "Configuration details:"
msgstr "設定の詳細："

#: arrayfire.md:61 arrayfire.md:74 arrayfire.md:126
msgid "Compile and install the source code:"
msgstr "コンパイルしてインストールします。"

#: arrayfire.md:65
msgid ""
"In case of slowdowns, specify the number of processors to use, in this case "
"8:"
msgstr "遅い場合は Processor 数を指定します。ここでは8です。"

#: arrayfire.md:69
msgid ""
"Move to the fftw-3.3.10 folder and configure new instructions with the "
"64-bit floating point support:"
msgstr "fftw-3.3.10 に移り、64-bit Float 用に設定します。"

#: arrayfire.md:78
msgid "Set the LD_LIBRARY_PATH environment variable directly in the shell:"
msgstr "Shell で LD_LIBRARY_PATH を設定します。"

#: arrayfire.md:82
msgid "Boost"
msgstr "Boost"

#: arrayfire.md:83
msgid ""
"Return to the download folder. Download the \"Boost C++\" libraries version "
"1.85.0:"
msgstr "ダウンロード先に戻り、Boost C++ 1.85.0 を取得します。"

#: arrayfire.md:91
msgid "Move into the boost folder:"
msgstr "boost に移ります。"

#: arrayfire.md:95
msgid "Initialise the Boost build system:"
msgstr "Boost のビルドシステムを初期化します。"

#: arrayfire.md:99
msgid ""
"Install Boost libraries specifying the directory where Boost will be "
"installed:"
msgstr "インストール先を指定して Boost を入れます。"

#: arrayfire.md:103
msgid ""
"Add the Boost library path to the LD_LIBRARY_PATH and the include path to "
"the PATH:"
msgstr "Boost の Library Path を LD_LIBRARY_PATH、Include Path を PATH に加えます。"

#: arrayfire.md:108
msgid "Spdlog"
msgstr "Spdlog"

#: arrayfire.md:109
msgid ""
"Return to the download folder. Clone and move into the spdlog repository:"
msgstr "ダウンロード先に戻り、spdlog を Clone して移ります。"

#: arrayfire.md:114
msgid "Checkout the specific version 1.9.2:"
msgstr "1.9.2 を Checkout します。"

#: arrayfire.md:118
msgid "Create build directory and navigate into it:"
msgstr "build を作って移ります。"

#: arrayfire.md:122
msgid "Run CMake to configure the build:"
msgstr "CMake で設定します。"

#: arrayfire.md:130
msgid "Set the environment variables:"
msgstr "環境変数を設定します。"

#: arrayfire.md:135
msgid "Link to libcuda library"
msgstr "libcuda への Link"

#: arrayfire.md:136
msgid ""
"The next step can be tricky as it involves identifying a specific CUDA "
"library on the cluster and linking it to your home directory. As the "
"installation takes place on the login node, the CUDA drivers may not be "
"directly available during code compilation. As an alternative, the stub "
"library `libcuda.so` must be found on the HPC system. If the location is not"
" clear, use the following command to find it:"
msgstr ""
"Cluster 内の CUDA Library を特定して Home に Link するため、注意が必要です。Login Node ではビルド時に "
"CUDA Driver を利用できない場合があります。代わりに Stub `libcuda.so` を探します。場所が不明なら次を使います。"

#: arrayfire.md:140
msgid ""
"For Leonardo, the `libcuda.so` compatible with toolkit version 11.8 is "
"located at:"
msgstr "Leonardo の Toolkit 11.8 対応 `libcuda.so` は次にあります。"

#: arrayfire.md:144
msgid "Create a folder in your home directory to link the library:"
msgstr "Home に Link 用フォルダを作ります。"

#: arrayfire.md:148
msgid "Link the library:"
msgstr "Library を Link します。"

#: arrayfire.md:152 arrayfire.md:198
msgid "Update the LD_LIBRARY_PATH environment variable:"
msgstr "LD_LIBRARY_PATH を更新します。"

#: arrayfire.md:156
msgid "3. Building and installing ArrayFire from source"
msgstr "3. ArrayFire の Source ビルドとインストール"

#: arrayfire.md:157
msgid "Return to the download folder. Clone the ArrayFire repository:"
msgstr "ダウンロード先に戻り、ArrayFire を Clone します。"

#: arrayfire.md:161
msgid ""
"Move into the arrayfire directory and checkout the specific version "
"(v3.9.0):"
msgstr "arrayfire に移り、v3.9.0 を Checkout します。"

#: arrayfire.md:166
msgid "Create a build directory and navigate into it:"
msgstr "build を作って移ります。"

#: arrayfire.md:170
msgid "Configure the build system with CMake:"
msgstr "CMake で設定します。"

#: arrayfire.md:190
msgid "Build and install ArrayFire:"
msgstr "ArrayFire をビルド・インストールします。"

#: arrayfire.md:194
msgid ""
"Check that `libafcuda.so` is correctly built, all the required shared "
"libraries must be resolved:"
msgstr "`libafcuda.so` が正しくでき、全 Shared Library が解決されることを確認します。"

#: arrayfire.md:202
msgid "4. Installing PLUMED2 with ArrayFire support"
msgstr "4. ArrayFire 対応 PLUMED2 のインストール"

#: arrayfire.md:203
msgid "Clone the PLUMED repository:"
msgstr "PLUMED を Clone します。"

#: arrayfire.md:207
msgid "Navigate to the PLUMED directory:"
msgstr "PLUMED に移ります。"

#: arrayfire.md:211
msgid "Configure the build system:"
msgstr "ビルドシステムを設定します。"

#: arrayfire.md:232
msgid "Build and install PLUMED:"
msgstr "PLUMED をビルド・インストールします。"

#: arrayfire.md:236
msgid "5. Logout & login"
msgstr "5. Logout と Login"

#: arrayfire.md:237
msgid ""
"To prevent compatibility issues caused by exporting the stub library, "
"completely logout of the HPC shell and perform a clean login. Avoiding this "
"step could result in \"CUDA device native identification\" errors."
msgstr ""
"Stub Library の Export による互換性問題を防ぐため、HPC Shell から完全に Logout し、Login "
"し直します。省くと「CUDA device native identification」エラーが出る場合があります。"

#: arrayfire.md:239
msgid "6. Write & run the SLURM batch script"
msgstr "6. SLURM Batch Script の作成と実行"

#: arrayfire.md:240
msgid "Create a SLURM batch file, e.g. `RUN.sh`, using a text editor:"
msgstr "Text Editor で `RUN.sh` などを作ります。"

#: arrayfire.md:244
msgid ""
"Set the job configuration, the modules, the environment variables and run "
"the PLUMED driver command:"
msgstr "Job、Module、環境変数を設定し、PLUMED driver を実行します。"

#: arrayfire.md:291
msgid ""
"In this example, the plumed command launches the driver to analyse the "
"molecular dynamics trajectory `trj.xtc` according to the `plumed.dat` file. "
"For the details regarding the `plumed.dat`instructions, refer to the "
"Tutorial 1 of this guide."
msgstr ""
"この例は `plumed.dat` に従って `trj.xtc` を解析します。`plumed.dat` の詳細は Tutorial "
"1を参照してください。"

#: arrayfire.md:293
msgid "Run the SLURM script file:"
msgstr "SLURM Script を実行します。"

#: arrayfire.md:298
msgid "7. Running GROMACS with PLUMED support"
msgstr "7. PLUMED 対応 GROMACS の実行"

#: arrayfire.md:299
msgid ""
"In addition to analysing a PDB or MD trajectory with the driver, it is "
"possible to generate a conformational ensemble that agrees with SAS data "
"using an MD engine. To enable this feature in GROMACS, it must be patched "
"with the plumed-patch module and compiled with MPI support. Here is an "
"example of a SLURM script that, after loading dependencies and environment "
"variables, launches GROMACS with PLUMED support:"
msgstr ""
"driver による PDB・Trajectory 解析だけでなく、MD エンジンで SAS と一致する Ensemble "
"を生成できます。GROMACS は plumed-patch で Patch し、MPI 対応でビルドします。依存と環境変数を設定後に起動する "
"SLURM の例です。"

#: arrayfire.md:359
msgid ""
"In this example a single node is dedicated to perform a multidir simulation "
"of 4 replicas, one for each GPU."
msgstr "1 Node で4 Replica の multidir を行い、各 GPU に1 Replica を割り当てます。"

#: arrayfire.md:361
msgid "8. Final notes"
msgstr "8. 最後の注意"

#: arrayfire.md:362
msgid ""
"This guide was written and verified in June 2024, using the latest version "
"of PLUMED available at that time. The names, paths, and versions of the "
"modules can vary between HPC systems. Even for Leonardo, a software stack "
"update might make this guide partially incompatible. However, all provided "
"examples should offer a broad logic to customize and adapt the installation "
"on local machines or other HPC systems."
msgstr ""
"この手順は2024年6月に当時の最新 PLUMED で検証しました。Module の名前・Path・バージョンは HPC により異なり、Leonardo"
" でも更新で一部合わなくなる場合があります。例の基本的な考え方を使い、ローカルやほかの HPC に調整してください。"

#: arrayfire.md:364
msgid "[Back to hySAS home](NAVIGATION.md)"
msgstr "[hySAS のホームに戻る](NAVIGATION.md)"
